        "citation": "Pace P. Nielsen, Mathematics of Computation 84 (2015), 2549-2567.",
        "url": "https://www.ams.org/mcom/2015-84-295/S0025-5718-2015-02941-X/S0025-5718-2015-02941-X.pdf"
