        "citation": "Bruno Dular, Primitive Feynman Diagrams and the Rational Goussarov\u2013Habiro Lie Algebra of String Links, AGT 26:3 (2026), pp. 1037\u20131038, definitions and m=1 separation question; Ohtsuki problem list for oriented-knot formulation.",
